 private List<Integer> matches(){if(search==null||search.getValue().isBlank())return List.of();String q=BookMarkup.searchable(search.getValue());var found=new ArrayList<Integer>();for(int i=0;i<ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.size();i++){var e=ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.get(i);if(menu.visible(i)&&menu.categoryUnlocked(ResearchCatalog.CATEGORIES.indexOf(e.category()))&&BookMarkup.searchable(label(e.name())).contains(q))found.add(i);}return found;}
 private void openSearchResult(int slot){var found=matches();if(slot>=found.size())return;int id=found.get(slot);var e=ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.get(id);category=ResearchCatalog.CATEGORIES.indexOf(e.category());var t=ResearchAtlas.TOPICS.get(e.key());cameras[category].center(t.x(),t.y(),mapW,mapH);centered[category]=true;search.setValue("");minecraft.gameMode.handleInventoryButtonClick(menu.containerId,1000+id);pending=id;dragging=false;position();}
 private ArtButton reader(String kind,Component label,Button.OnPress press){var b=addRenderableWidget(new ArtButton(0,0,24,14,label,kind,0,press));readerControls.add(b);return b;}
 private boolean inside(double x,double y){return x>=leftPos+3&&x<leftPos+mapW-3&&y>=topPos+3&&y<topPos+mapH-3;}
 private void ensureCentered(){if(centered[category])return;var target=ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.stream().filter(e->e.category().equals(ResearchCatalog.CATEGORIES.get(category))&&menu.visible(ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.indexOf(e))).filter(e->menu.stage(ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.indexOf(e))>0&&menu.stage(ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.indexOf(e))<=e.stages().size()).findFirst().orElse(null);if(target==null)target=ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.stream().filter(e->e.category().equals(ResearchCatalog.CATEGORIES.get(category))&&menu.visible(ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.indexOf(e))).findFirst().orElse(null);var root=ResearchCatalog.BY_KEY.get(category==0?"FIRSTSTEPS":"BASE"+ResearchCatalog.CATEGORIES.get(category));if(root!=null&&menu.visible(ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.indexOf(root)))target=root;var t=target==null?null:ResearchAtlas.TOPICS.get(target.key());cameras[category].center(t==null?0:t.x(),t==null?0:t.y(),mapW,mapH);centered[category]=true;}
 private void position(){int row=0;for(int c=0;c<7;c++){var b=tabs.get(c);b.visible=!reading&&menu.categoryUnlocked(c);b.active=c!=category;b.setX(leftPos-29);b.setY(topPos+row*29);if(b.visible)row++;}
  var camera=cameras[category];for(int i=0;i<nodes.size();i++){var b=nodes.get(i);var e=ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.get(i);var t=ResearchAtlas.TOPICS.get(e.key());int size=(int)Math.round(32*camera.zoom());b.setWidth(size);b.setHeight(size);b.setX(leftPos+(int)Math.round(camera.screenX(t.x()))-size/2);b.setY(topPos+(int)Math.round(camera.screenY(t.y()))-size/2);b.visible=!reading&&menu.validData()&&menu.visible(i)&&e.category().equals(ResearchCatalog.CATEGORIES.get(category))&&b.getX()+size>leftPos&&b.getX()<leftPos+mapW&&b.getY()+size>topPos&&b.getY()<topPos+mapH;}
  center.visible=!reading;center.setX(leftPos+mapW-70);center.setY(topPos+mapH+3);
  if(search!=null){search.visible=!reading;var found=matches();for(int i=0;i<results.size();i++){var b=results.get(i);b.visible=!reading&&i<found.size();b.setX(leftPos+mapW-128);b.setY(topPos+5+i*17);if(b.visible){b.setMessage(Component.translatable(ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.get(found.get(i)).name()));b.setTooltip(Tooltip.create(b.getMessage()));}}}
  for(var b:readerControls)b.visible=reading;back.setX(bookX);back.setY(Math.max(0,bookY-15));previous.setX(bookX+4);previous.setWidth(18);previous.setY(bookY+bookH-30);next.setX(bookX+bookW-22);next.setWidth(18);next.setY(bookY+bookH-30);shortcut.setX(bookX+bookW/4-Math.min(60,bookW/2-50)/2);shortcut.setY(bookY+bookH-30);shortcut.setWidth(Math.min(60,bookW/2-50));advance.setX(bookX+bookW*3/4-Math.min(80,bookW/2-50)/2);advance.setY(bookY+bookH-30);advance.setWidth(Math.min(80,bookW/2-50));advance.active=menu.ready();shortcut.visible=reading&&!recipeKeys().isEmpty();previous.active=spread>0;next.active=spread+1<spreads();
 }
 public void containerTick(){super.containerTick();if(!menu.validData())return;if(!menu.categoryUnlocked(category))category=0;ensureCentered();if(pending>=0&&menu.selected()==pending&&menu.stage(pending)>0){reading=true;pending=-1;spread=0;}if(lastSelected!=menu.selected()||lastStage!=menu.stage(menu.selected())){lastSelected=menu.selected();lastStage=menu.stage(menu.selected());spread=0;}spread=Math.min(spread,spreads()-1);position();}
 private void turn(int target){if(spread!=target){spread=target;if(minecraft.player!=null)minecraft.player.playSound(net.minecraft.sounds.SoundEvents.BOOK_PAGE_TURN,.6F,1);}}
 private void returnToMap(){reading=false;pending=-1;dragging=false;position();}
 public void onClose(){if(reading)returnToMap();else super.onClose();}
 public boolean mouseClicked(MouseButtonEvent e,boolean twice){if(!reading&&results.stream().noneMatch(b->b.visible&&b.isMouseOver(e.x(),e.y()))&&inside(e.x(),e.y())&&(e.button()==InputConstants.MOUSE_BUTTON_RIGHT||e.button()==InputConstants.MOUSE_BUTTON_LEFT&&nodes.stream().noneMatch(b->b.visible&&b.isMouseOver(e.x(),e.y())))){dragging=true;return true;}return super.mouseClicked(e,twice);}
 public boolean mouseDragged(MouseButtonEvent e,double dx,double dy){if(dragging&&!reading){cameras[category].pan(dx,dy);position();return true;}return super.mouseDragged(e,dx,dy);}
 public boolean mouseReleased(MouseButtonEvent e){if(dragging){dragging=false;return true;}return super.mouseReleased(e);}
 public boolean mouseScrolled(double x,double y,double horizontal,double vertical){if(!reading&&inside(x,y)){cameras[category].zoom(vertical,x-leftPos,y-topPos);position();return true;}return super.mouseScrolled(x,y,horizontal,vertical);}
 public boolean keyPressed(net.minecraft.client.input.KeyEvent event){if(search!=null&&search.visible&&search.isFocused()&&event.key()!=InputConstants.KEY_ESCAPE){if(search.keyPressed(event))return true;return false;}return super.keyPressed(event);}
 public String searchQuery(){return search==null?"":search.getValue();}
 public int searchMatches(){return matches().size();}
 public boolean readerLayoutFits(){if(!reading)return true;for(var b:List.of(shortcut,advance,previous,next))if(b.visible&&(b.getX()<bookX||b.getY()<bookY||b.getX()+b.getWidth()>bookX+bookW||b.getY()+b.getHeight()>bookY+bookH))return false;if(pageY+pageHeight>bookY+bookH-50)return false;for(var topic:ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES)if(font.split(Component.translatable(topic.name()),(int)(pageWidth/.8F)).size()>2)return false;layoutText();for(var page:textPages)for(var part:page)if(part.y()+part.height()>(int)(pageHeight/TEXT_SCALE))return false;return previous.getX()+previous.getWidth()<=shortcut.getX()&&shortcut.getX()+shortcut.getWidth()<=advance.getX()&&advance.getX()+advance.getWidth()<=next.getX();}
 public String layoutDescription(){return "GUI "+width+"x"+height+"; book "+bookX+","+bookY+" "+bookW+"x"+bookH+"; text bottom "+(pageY+pageHeight)+"; Recipe "+shortcut.getX()+","+shortcut.getY()+"; Continue "+advance.getX()+","+advance.getY();}
 public boolean mapView(){return !reading;}public int currentCategory(){return category;}public double zoom(){return cameras[category].zoom();}
 public double[] nodeCenter(String key){var b=nodes.get(ResearchCatalog.ENTRIES.indexOf(ResearchCatalog.BY_KEY.get(key)));return new double[]{b.getX()+b.getWidth()/2D,b.getY()+b.getHeight()/2D};}
